WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Universities and anchor firms are anchors; the district is an incubator; community is infrastructure.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
One axis, three cores and two wings locate fifteen projects from validation to incubation and first orders.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Three detailed areas align spatial products, sections, flows and stop gates.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Twelve bounded scenarios retain non-AI equivalents, human takeover and stop conditions.

5
00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Agents cannot self-sign; boundaries, engineering, operations and field outcomes await professional verification.
